# A lap is SNE (skipping the exit), SUB, JMP back: the SUBs are instructions 2, 5 and 8, so x (B of
# cell 5) is 1 after 7 and 0 after 8; then SNE does not skip (10) and JMP leaves (11), and the
# warrior stays on JMP #0.
golden: bbctests/examples/while_ne.bbc
cell 7 5 DAT.F #0, #1
cell 8 5 DAT.F #0, #0
alive 100
